        ["pengarang", "author"], ["mengakhiri", "ended"], ["ceritanya", "his-story"], "."
      ]
    },
    {
      "en": "He stated that when Narcissus died, the forest goddesses appeared and found the lake, which had originally been fresh water, transformed into a lake of salty tears.",
      "t": [
        ["Dia", "he"], ["menyatakan", "stated"], ["bahwa", "that"],
