    },
    {
      "en": "Finally, it spoke:",
      "t": [["Akhirnya", "finally"], ",", ["ia", "it"], ["berkata", "spoke"], ":"]
    },
    "PARA",
    {
      "dialog": true,
      "en": "\"I weep for Narcissus, but I never noticed that Narcissus was beautiful.",
